    "Name": "Hephaestus Scout Tank N",
    "Details": "The N configuration of the Hephaestus Hovertank is an infantry fighting vehicle. Its turret mounts five AP Gauss Rifles, aided by a Clan advanced targeting computer and a Clan Nova CEWS, and it also carries a Clan Active Probe and a Battle Armor Compartment.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 8/12 hexes / 240/360 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       105     15\n<b>Left</b>         100     15\n<b>Right</b>       100     15\n<b>Rear</b>        100     15\n<b>Turret</b>       95     15\n\n<b>Total</b>      500     75</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Missile Jammer</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Omni Vehicle</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Can carry 1 Battle Armor Squads.</color>",
